<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8806] SQL: NPE in GridH2ProxyIndex when trying to access lookup batch</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8806</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;See &lt;tt&gt;GridH2ProxyIndex#createLookupBatch&lt;/tt&gt; - it calls the same method on real index and returns wrapped batch unconditionally.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But according to the contract of this method, index may return &lt;tt&gt;null&lt;/tt&gt;. Proxy index should return &lt;tt&gt;null&lt;/tt&gt; in this case as well.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13166291">IGNITE-8806</key>
